---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro'
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Delete Account"
  description="Request deletion of your Music Memory account and all associated data."
  canonical="/delete-account"
>
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 py-24" style="color: var(--ink-90)">
      <div class="text-center mb-12">
        <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-extrabold mb-4" style="color: var(--ink)">Delete Account</h1>
        <p class="text-lg" style="color: var(--ink-90)">
          We&apos;re sorry to see you go. If you wish to delete your Music Memory account and all associated data, follow the instructions below.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-8 glass p-8 rounded-3xl border border-red-500/20 relative overflow-hidden">
        <div class="absolute top-0 left-0 w-full h-1 bg-gradient-to-r from-red-600 to-red-900" />

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4" style="color: var(--ink)">How to delete your account</h2>
          <ol class="list-decimal pl-5 space-y-3 leading-relaxed" style="color: var(--ink-90)">
            <li>Open the Music Memory app and navigate to <strong style="color: var(--ink)">Settings</strong> via the tab bar at the bottom of the screen.</li>
            <li>Scroll down to the <strong style="color: var(--ink)">Danger Zone</strong> section and tap <strong style="color: var(--ink)">Delete Account</strong>.</li>
            <li>You will be prompted to confirm your password. Once confirmed, your account will be scheduled for permanent deletion in <strong style="color: var(--ink)">14 days</strong>.</li>
          </ol>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4" style="color: var(--ink)">What happens after you request deletion?</h2>
          <p class="leading-relaxed mb-4">
            Once deletion is scheduled, the following applies during the 14-day grace period:
          </p>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-2" style="color: var(--ink-90)">
            <li>Your profile will be hidden from other users</li>
            <li>All of your public memories will be hidden from the community</li>
            <li>You can cancel the deletion at any time by simply signing back in to your account</li>
          </ul>
          <p class="leading-relaxed mt-4">
            After the 14-day grace period, your account and all associated data — including journal entries, media files, and profile information — will be <strong style="color: var(--ink)">permanently and irreversibly deleted</strong>. This action cannot be undone.
          </p>
        </section>
      </div>
    </div>
</BaseLayout>
